# iceland-device-hypr: re-apply the workspace layout when the tablet / laptop mode changes (iceland-mode-publish)
[Unit]
Description=OnePlus Pad 4: watch the tablet / laptop mode for Omarchy's workspace layout
ConditionUser=!@system
PartOf=graphical-session.target
After=graphical-session.target
[Path]
PathChanged=/run/iceland/mode
Unit=iceland-tablet-layout.service
[Install]
WantedBy=graphical-session.target
